  "html": "<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"-------png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:133px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/zh/wiki/File:%E4%BB%8E%E8%80%85.png\" title=\"从者.png (225 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:133px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/7/79/%E4%BB%8E%E8%80%85.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/133?cb=20251023165053&amp;path-prefix=zh\" title=\"从者.png (225 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"从者.png\" data-image-key=\"%E4%BB%8E%E8%80%85.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"从者.png (225 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"从者.png\" data-image-key=\"%E4%BB%8E%E8%80%85.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/7/79/%E4%BB%8E%E8%80%85.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/133?cb=20251023165053&amp;path-prefix=zh\"></a></div></div></div></div><p>【角色名】从者\n</p><p>【初始区域】学校/都市（由剧本规定）\n</p><p>【禁行区域】无\n</p><p>【不安限度】3\n</p><p>【属性】成人·女性\n</p><p>【特性】同一區域的大人物或大小姐移動時，无视自身移动并跟隨那名角色移動（如果多名角色同時移動，由主人公選擇跟隨哪名角色）。同一區域的大人物或大小姐死亡時，代替那名角色死亡\n</p><p>【友好能力】（友好4 1L1）选择场上的另外1名角色，本轮轮回中，将那名角色追加至特性适用对象中。\n</p><p>【感想】 我身做盾，我要做守护之王！\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260927033242\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal ti